      {
        "pkcontributionId": 126357,
        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 373,
        "headingId": 768,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>None</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-25T08:24:16"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 826,
    "bookid": 64,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Localization",
    "headingPosition": 6,
    "headingid": 769,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 126358,
        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 373,
        "headingId": 769,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Onychocytic matricoma is composed of areas of matrix epithelium and nail plate localized within a single nail unit.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-25T08:24:16"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 827,
    "bookid": 64,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Clinical features",
    "headingPosition": 7,
    "headingid": 770,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 126359,
        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 373,
        "headingId": 770,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Most reported cases of onychocytic matricoma have clinically presented as longitudinal pachymelanonychia (a longitudinal hyperpigmented streak in the nail unit associated with thickening of the nail plate). Rare cases with hypopigmentation have also been reported, where the thickened nail plate demonstrates longitudinal pachyxanthonychia (a yellow discolouration of the nail, with a thickened nail plate) {22197859; 23521538; 31090828}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-25T08:24:16"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 828,
    "bookid": 64,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Epidemiology",
    "headingPosition": 8,
    "headingid": 771,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 126360,
        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 373,
        "headingId": 771,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Onychocytic matricoma is an unusual condition, and epidemiological studies have not been performed.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-25T08:24:16"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 829,
